41405::$$$message_0293_0000_0000$$$::"These are Rider's immortal sisters[br]Stheno and Euryale."::
41406::$$$message_0293_0001_0000$$$::"...By the way, how do you tell them apart?"::
41407::$$$message_0293_0002_0000$$$::"Only their names and personalities are different.[br]Also, their hair and cellular makeup are identical.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01g2(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01g2(中)]Their love for their little sister Rider, too."::
41408::$$$message_0293_0003_0000$$$::"...I feel sorry for Rider."::
41409::$$$message_0293_0004_0000$$$::"Huh, why? She has such cute and beautiful big sisters."::
41410::$$$message_0293_0005_0000$$$::"...Unfortunately.":��